35e5e931186a6e27876517317d2bcb7b89581/ss_e4f35e5e931186a6e27876517317d2bcb7b89581.600x338.jpg?t=1755701246"}],"short_description":"Ruby's Realms is a platformer blending metroidvania exploration with level-based challenges in mysterious cursed realms. Leap across precarious platforms, blast cultists and possessed monsters with magic flames. Collect upgrade points and buy upgrades from your friend, Skully.","steam_appid":3861720,"support_info":{"email":"contact@chillingmoose.com","url":"https://chillingmoose.com"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://chillingmoose.com"}